{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-09-14 12:00:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK UNVEILS PLANS FOR BUSINESS & INNOVATION HUB IN FRISCO, TEXAS', 'text': 'FRISCO BUSINESS & INNOVATION HUB SET TO MAKE DEBUT AT THE STAR IN LATE 2023 DALLAS , SEPT. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA INCORPORATED\xa0(NYSE: CMA) TODAY ANNOUNCED CORPORATE EXPANSION PLANS IN NORTH TEXAS WITH DEVELOPMENT UNDERWAY FOR ITS NEW BUSINESS & INNOVATION HUB IN FRISCO.'}